BT 1 0 0 1 38 471 Tm (Adjoin the primes p>Z in increasing order. The exact normalized recurrence is) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 462 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 453 Tm (  U_i\(Y\) = U_\(i-1\)\(Y\) - p_i^\(-1\) U_\(i-1\)\(Y/p_i\).) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 444 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 435 Tm (Telescoping gives) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 426 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 417 Tm (  U_full\(X\) = U_Z\(X\) - SUM_\(Z<p<=X/2\) p^\(-1\) U_<p\(X/p\).) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 408 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 399 Tm (Every nonempty large-prime history is owned exactly once by its largest prime.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 390 Tm (Expanding the child yields the source-faithful signed correlation) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 381 Tm  T* ET
