BT 1 0 0 1 38 210 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 201 Tm (It is source-faithful and preserves every Mobius sign and largest-prime owner.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 192 Tm (No unrestricted reservoir or source-blind large sieve is used.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 183 Tm  T* ET
